  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nGiven equation: **26 + 2 ÷ 4 - 8 × 25 = 30**\n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **× and -**\n\n→ 26 + **2 ÷ 4** × 8 - 25 = 30\n\n→ 26 + **1/2 ×**** 8** - 25 = 30\n\n→ **26 + 4** - 25 = 30\n\n→ 30 - 25 = 30\n\n→ 5 ≠ 30\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **+ and ÷**\n\n→ **26 ÷ 2** + 4 - 8 × 25 = 30\n\n→ 13 + 4 - **8 × 25** = 30\n\n→ **13 ****+ 4** - 200 = 30\n\n→ 17 - 200 = 30\n\n→ - 183 ≠ 30\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **× and +**\n\n→ 26 × **2 ÷ 4** - 8 + 25 = 30\n\n→ **26 × 1/2** - 8 + 25 = 30\n\n→ **13** - 8 **+ 25** = 30\n\n→ 38 - 8 = 30\n\n→ 30 = 30\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\n4) **×**** and ÷**\n\n→ 26 + 2 × 4 - **8 ÷ 25** = 30\n\n→ 26 + **2 ****×**** 4** - 8/25 = 30\n\n→ **26 + 8** - 8/25 = 30\n\n→ 34 - 8/25 ≠ 30\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****× and +\"**.",
